<title>ARGENTINA: Banco Frances coordinates sale of Siderar shares.</title>
<headline>Banco Frances coordinates sale of Siderar shares.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Banco Frances said it coordinated the sale Thursday of 24.8 million shares af Argentine steelmaker Siderar at $2.60 per share.</p>
<p>The sale was commissioned by PORT International NV and registred over the counter, Banco Frances told the Buenos Aires Stock exchange.</p>
<p>No other details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650</p>
